Now the AC'97 bring-up program. Standard ICH AC'97 register map:
- NABM (r1=0xc400): GLOB_CNT at 0x2C, GLOB_STA at 0x30. Cold reset = write bit1 (2) to GLOB_CNT, then poll GLOB_STA for a codec-ready bit.
- NAM (r0=0xc000): 0x00 reset, 0x02 master volume, 0x18 PCM out volume, 0x2C PCM front DAC rate.

Let me assemble and run the bring-up.
